d psychological introspection.Handmade in Finland.COMMUNITY FEATURESWithout a Dawn can load and read fan localizations!Create custom color palettes, frames, and textures!*Without a Dawn can load and read external voice acting!**Creating palettes, frames, and textures requires image editing software.*External voice acting requires audio editing software.*See the game folder for documentation.Press kit for the press, content creators, and influencers can be located on the official homepage."}